Record actual native clock and calculated RNG return values in an optional compact
log. This preserves every return and mixed API order without per-call debugger
stops. The observer changes no input or engine state, preserves errno and opens
its file exclusively. WASM retains its existing import observer. Physical timing
and game parity require separate actual-output comparisons.

